{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act18d0_level_act18d0_02_end",
  "groupId": "act18d0",
  "stageId": "act18d0_02",
  "title": "绿洲惊雷",
  "storyCode": "WD-2",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act18d0/level_act18d0_02_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "5e80f20783e8f0037f17c26138e3a00b786e8a595ac719b898f829316cd9c475",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "2下"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "十七年前\n1:37 P.M.  天气/晴\n乌萨斯中部，松心山谷疗养院，食堂大厅"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "先生，您的咖啡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老兵模样的人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——新来的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "是的，先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老兵模样的人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那该好好问问其他人，我喝咖啡的规矩是什么，给我把咖啡放凉了再端过来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老兵模样的人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你这该死的菲林——呵，菲林人！真让人恶心！我在战场上拼命，可不是为了被一个菲林照顾！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老兵模样的人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "给我滚开！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "......十分抱歉，先生，是我疏忽了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "请不要告诉护工长，我这就去为您重新准备......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老兵模样的人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......哼！不想丢工作的话，就在三分钟之内给我重新准备好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老兵模样的人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还有......你这眼神是怎么回事，如果你不懂怎么微笑的话，我就撕烂你的脸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "请别这样......很抱歉让您不愉快了，我这就去为您重新准备。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老兵模样的人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啐，现在的仆人，只有姿色能看了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "非常抱歉，先生，请不要动怒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "这对您的病情很不利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯军官",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_082",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "滚开！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "是、是，非常抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的护工",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小姑娘？喂，小姑娘！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "您是在叫我吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的护工",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎，对咯，小姑娘，刚才的我都看见啦，你可千万别气馁啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的护工",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那位是个纠察队的头子......按理说，那种人啊，是没有资格来疗养院的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "他可不是贵族......这样作威作福，就不怕得罪别人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的护工",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "据说他在某位侯爵身边很吃香......哎，不光如此，听说这次来疗养院，也不是因为什么“战场上留下的顽疾”，他哪上过战场。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的护工",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "听说是帮侯爵做了什么脏活，被侯爵送来避风头的呐。有这么个靠山，对我们这些下人，当然就肆无忌惮起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "......侯爵......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "没想到那样的无赖，竟然也会高攀上一位侯爵老爷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的护工",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可不是！指不定哪天他就被安排成哪里的小老爷啦！穿着光鲜亮丽地坐在老大的办公桌后面......唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的护工",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "总之，你可别生气，惹上这种人，可比粘上源石虫还麻烦。像你这么年轻的好姑娘，干嘛要来这个地方工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的护工",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "千万别说是我告诉你的呀，也别四处乱打听，不然会惹火上身的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "是......我明白了，谢谢您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的护工",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，你下次见到他，躲远些，天知道他会对你做什么——咦，那是新来的医生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......凯尔希。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "医生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的护工",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，哦，原来你们认识......那不打扰你们啦，现在可不是休息时间，小心些，别让护工长瞅见了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她很关心我们这些新来的，她是个好人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "说得对，路易莎医生，我们都不能辜负她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一会你还有别的工作吗？我有些话想对你说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "抱歉，医生......我还要去冲一杯新的咖啡，如果那位侯爵的宠儿没有继续找茬的话，我随后就去找你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那好吧......记得小心些，凯尔希。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "路易莎医生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......现在只有我们两个人，凯尔希，你应该选一个化名。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "“路易莎”，借用你女儿的名字，这种程度的伪装简直是看不起秘密警察的手段。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "在他们眼里，我已经死了。而这件事结束之后，我会离开乌萨斯，也许很久都不会回来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "不会有人知道大公死于行刺。等他们再次来到大公身旁，只会发现他因衰老而停止了呼吸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......乌萨斯的技术不足以分析你制的毒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "目前而言，这的确超过了他们对“毒物”的理解范畴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你的知识究竟能领先乌萨斯多少年？所长？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "帝国的进步已经超乎我的想象了，但现在不必讨论这些细节。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "莉莉娅，你们所希望的仲裁只能以这种方式结束。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "你们没有办法奢求更进一步的报复，能将大公的荣耀与意义一并抹去的，只有乌萨斯至高无上的皇帝本人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我知道......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "好。那么，就是这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的，我们并不知道万尼亚大公身患何种顽疾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我从护工长那里了解到，每天下午三点，万尼亚大公会离开他的私人监护室，来到这里休憩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这场日光浴往往持续到日落，偶尔有客人来访的时候，大公会直接与他们在这里共进晚餐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们不可能靠近大公的私房，但是这里......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "我们现在就站在这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但他不可能没有护卫陪同，届时，这整条走廊都会遭到卫队的封锁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "除了被大公特许陪同的客人之外，就只有大公的医疗顾问，以及佣人，可以进入这片区域。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "即使如此，乌萨斯的贵族也不会随便允许疗养院的员工来到这处阳台。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "我们已经待了足够久了，时间越久，风险越高。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我明白。一定会有什么空隙，一定会有一个机会......大公的医疗顾问是轮班制的，也许很快就是我。今天，或者明天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "莉莉娅，你实话告诉我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "大公死后，你要何去何从？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "为什么现在要问这个？我们应该专注于眼前的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "我希望你能如实回答。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在我们抵达松心山谷之前，我收到了万比洛夫家发来的最后一封信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谢尔盖依旧在勤勤恳恳地为鲍里斯服务，而那座城市......转移了航道。也许这是某个转变的开始。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们杀了那么多人......他们却那么心安理得，高枕无忧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "你了解过谢尔盖的背叛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......但任何借口都换不回已死的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谢尔盖提供不了更多的科学援助，也许过个几年，项目就会被正式叫停。然后？坐视谢尔盖和鲍里斯继续沆瀣一气，作威作福？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "即使万尼亚大公死了，你也不打算停下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我无法原谅谢尔盖。我第一次认识他时，喝醉了的阿斯特罗夫还兴奋地抱着我，向我倾诉他拥有一帮怎样正直且优秀的同事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他曾经无比憧憬这份事业，我也支持他，尽我所能地支持他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "直到现在都是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "凯尔希所长，你其实什么都知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果你不打算说，那么我会亲自回到切尔诺伯格，我要做个彻底的了断。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "万比洛夫家为我们准备了一条逃向萨米的后路，但也许，我没有机会搭上那些信使的顺风车。而你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "我自有打算。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呵......当然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我很清楚，我在引火上身。所以......凯尔希，无论你打不打算向我坦白所有真相，至少有一点，我想请你答应。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道我在做一件很疯狂的事情，我也知道也许你说的才是对的。但我现在只有一个请求，照顾好我的女儿，照顾好路易莎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "下一代不需要承受仇恨的烦扰......哪怕最终谁都逃不出这个循环，但是答应我，凯尔希，照顾好她。如果可能的话，也请照顾好柳德米拉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "护工的声音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "路易莎医生？路易莎医生，你在哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这儿！请稍等！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "凯尔希......我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "我答应你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "这只是一个母亲最后的愿望。路易莎会成长起来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿斯特罗夫，他最后一次握着小路易莎的手的时候，半开玩笑地说过一席话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他说，他希望小路易莎和我一样，成为一个医学研究者，等到路易莎上学的年纪，他希望凯尔希所长来当小路易莎的启蒙老师。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "是啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这是他那晚突然启程去研究所之前，对他女儿说过的最后一席话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的护工",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，医生，您在这里！太好啦，你要是再迟点，护工长又要发飙咯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的护工",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？医生，您的眼睛怎么红了？发生什么事了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......没事，怎么了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的护工",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "到了巡房的时间啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我都没注意......好，我知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那边似乎很热闹？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的护工",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是，好像有位贵族老爷从很远的地方来拜访，也不知道为了什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的护工",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这日子平平稳稳就好咯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您好——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "打扰了，现在是巡房的时间......预定的访客表上似乎没有安排，请问您是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_076",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一位心血来潮，来探望老朋友的乌萨斯公民而已，请继续吧，女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_076",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但愿我没有打搅各位的工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老兵模样的人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "维特，你要走了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_076",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，老朋友，我一会再来找你。冬天到了，你该多注意保养，你哮喘的老毛病别又犯了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_076",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "请吧，女士，我在大厅等着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（这个人......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯军官",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_082",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "维特大臣！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_076",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "请注意安静。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯军官",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_082",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，不，抱歉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯军官",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_082",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大公不知道您的造访，这是我们的工作疏忽，为表歉意，大公邀您共进晚餐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯军官",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_082",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "希望您理解，大公的身体抱恙，若非如此，他一定会亲自来见您......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老兵模样的人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，抱歉，十分抱歉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯军官",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_082",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你怎么回事！怎么敢当着大臣的面——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老兵模样的人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔，没事，只是一些酒精洒在了床单上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_076",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别激动，女士，怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "对不起，消毒酒精的拧口太紧，我用力过猛了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_076",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你本可以找别人帮忙的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉，非常抱歉，我这就去取抹布来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_076",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......可怜的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_076",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "说回大公的邀请吧，很遗憾，信使还在等我，我可能等不到那个时候了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_076",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "请替我转告万尼亚，让他在这里安心休养。不过也请他记得，这里是陛下给予功勋者的恩赐之地，而非为贵族们提供的又一处社交场所。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯军官",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_082",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊......好的，好的......如果您坚持的话......大公会非常遗憾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_076",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这是公务。如果一定要在陛下和大公之间选择一位，我只好委屈万尼亚大公了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯军官",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_082",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃......！您早说呀，若是如此，大公一定会体谅大臣您的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯军官",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_082",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "祝福您道路长青。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_076",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "代我向他问好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "路易莎医生，您怎么了......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "凯尔希，他是谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "伊斯拉姆·维特子爵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你认得他......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "乌萨斯新任财政大臣，深得皇恩青睐的新晋贵族。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "没事的，路易莎医生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "我并不深刻了解他的为人，也不知道他具体的发迹缘由。但就我所知，他是当今的乌萨斯皇帝亲手扶持的栋梁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "而这样的青年俊杰，目光只会放向整片乌萨斯浩大的土地。切尔诺伯格的风波对整个帝国所面临的风波而言，不过是浩大浪潮下些微的涟漪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "就算是一位乌萨斯大公——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "——慢着......慢着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "财政大臣来到松心山谷，却仍旧没有任何武装随行吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_168_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔......似乎没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kaltsn09_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kaltsn09",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
